3
Envelope 1
3
0.000     0.000     LINEAR              FLEXIBLE    0.250
0.250     1.000     EXPONENTIAL         FIXED       0.750
1.000     0.000
Envelope 2
2
0.000     1.000     LINEAR              FLEXIBLE    1.000
1.000     1.000
Envelope 3
4
0.000     0.200     CUBIC_SPLINE        FLEXIBLE    0.300
0.300     0.900     LINEAR              FIXED       0.300
0.600     0.400     EXPONENTIAL         FLEXIBLE    0.400
1.000     0.000
    </EnvelopeLibrary>
